[0] About CHARMM50 Development

     At the 2024 CHARMM meeting (University of Maryland, Baltimore
July 19-21, 2024) we decided to release CHARMM c50a1 incorporating enhancements
and fixes from the development versions c49a1 and c49a2.

The c50a1 release includes the enhancements and fixes to the development
version c49a2 during the period of August 15, 2023 through August 15, 2024.

==============================================================================

[1] c50a1 Change Log

     At the 2024 CHARMM meeting (University of Maryland, Baltimore
July 19-21, 2024), we decided to release CHARMM c49b1 incorporating enhancements
and fixes from the developmental c49a1 and c49a2 versions into the stable version.

The c50a1 release includes the following enhancements and fixes from the
developmental versions c49a1 and c49a2 during the development period of
August 15, 2023 through August 15, 2024. A selection of these have been added
to the stable version c48b2 to create the stable version c49b1.

