3.10 OpenMM 8.2 LangevinIntegrator becomes LangevinMiddleIntegrator
     Developer: Josh Buckner
     Institution: University of Michigan
     Date: 22 Nov 2024

Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/263
Git commit: 077a1890

Description:
The OpenMM API for integrators has changed with OpenMM 8.2.
OpenMM 8.2 LangevinIntegrator becomes LangevinMiddleIntegrator and
LangevinIntegrator is maybe a base class. A CPP protected block is added
specifically for OpenMM 8.2 where LangevinIntegrator becomes
LangevinMiddleIntegrator.

Files Involved:
source/fftdock/openmm_dock.F90
source/openmm/omm_main.F90

3.11 Pycharmm flexible CDOCKER output improvements
     Developer: Yujin Wu
     Institution: University of Michigan
     Date: 9 December 2024

Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/264
Git commit: e1a43fc4

Description:
1. The nature of the flexible CDOCKER will cluster the docking poses and
compute the final energy based on each cluster. The cluster information
(radius, membership) is now output in the final tsv files.
2. This information is also represented in the pdb files.
3. A brief summary of how Flexible CDOCKER is set up and explanation of the
final results is automatically saved in the file "output".
4. cluster.log (i.e., the clustering information) generated by mmtsb is also
saved so that one could always double check the result.

Files involved:
tool/pycharmm/pycharmm/cdocker.py
tool/pycharmm/tests/testFactsDockRescore.py

